OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785856710
OL,3,CFraudster who stole #300k from
OL,4,Cpensioner and fled to Spain has
OL,5,Csentence extended
OL,7,FA fugitive fraudster who went on the
OL,8,Frun to Spain for 16 months has been
OL,9,Fsentenced to an extra two months in
OL,10,Fjail.
OL,12,FPamela Gwinnett, 63, isolated 89-year-
OL,13,Fold Joan Green from her family while
OL,14,Fpretending to act as her carer during
OL,15,Fthe Covid-19 pandemic, transferring
OL,16,Fpower of attorney to herself and
OL,17,Fraiding the pensioner's life savings
OL,18,Fof around #300,000.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
