FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785856710
OL,3,CFraudster who stole #300k from
OL,4,Cpensioner and fled to Spain has
OL,5,Csentence extended
OL,7,FShe used the cash to fund an
OL,8,Fextravagant lifestyle, buying a car
OL,9,Fworth #22,500 and expensive beauty and
OL,10,FBotox treatments.
OL,12,FGwinnett fled to Tenerife while on
OL,13,Fbail as she awaited trial after an
OL,14,Finvestigation into her dealings with
OL,15,Fvulnerable Joan Green.
OL,17,FGwinnett, from Adlington, Lancashire
OL,18,Fwas convicted and sentenced in her
OL,19,Fabsence in October 2025 for a string
OL,20,Fof offences, including fraud by abuse
OL,21,Fof position and theft.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
