PN,36803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785856710
OL,3,CFraudster who stole #300k from
OL,4,Cpensioner and fled to Spain has
OL,5,Csentence extended
OL,7,FShe was arrested at her Tenerife
OL,8,Fapartment on 14 July, 2026 and was
OL,9,Ffurther detained on her arrival at
OL,10,FManchester Airport after extradition.
OL,12,FShe appeared at Preston Crown Court on
OL,13,FMonday 3 August, in the same clothes
OL,14,Fshe wore when she landed in the UK,
OL,15,Fafter she admitted breaching her bail
OL,16,Fconditions last year.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
