FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785856710
OL,3,CFraudster who stole #300k from
OL,4,Cpensioner and fled to Spain has
OL,5,Csentence extended
OL,7,FGwinnett boarded a plane to Tenerife
OL,8,Fin April 2025, just five hours after
OL,9,Fher application to vary her bail terms
OL,10,Fto allow her to purportedly scatter
OL,11,Fher brother's ashes on the island was
OL,12,Frefused.
OL,14,FShe also ignored bail conditions to
OL,15,Fsurrender her passport to her local
OL,16,Fpolice station within seven days.
OL,18,FSentencing her on Monday, Judge
OL,19,FMichael Maher said: "No evidence of a
OL,20,Fbrother has ever been produced, much
OL,21,Fless that he passed away.
OL,26,@{D@UOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
