OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,369,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785856710
OL,3,CFraudster who stole #300k from
OL,4,Cpensioner and fled to Spain has
OL,5,Csentence extended
OL,7,F"This was a deliberate and sustained
OL,8,Fattempted to evade justice."
OL,10,FIn mitigation, Rosalind Scott Bell
OL,11,Fsaid she had been instructed by her
OL,12,Fclient to apologise to the court.
OL,14,FGwinnett said she fled the
OL,15,Fjurisdiction out of "fear and anxiety"
OL,16,Fof being arrested and also suffered
OL,17,Ffrom "poor mental health", said the
OL,18,Fbarrister.
OL,26,@oD@AOUpD@\O]wD@UOUwD@fO]yD@FOUyD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/9
