PN,36806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785856710
OL,3,CFraudster who stole #300k from
OL,4,Cpensioner and fled to Spain has
OL,5,Csentence extended
OL,7,FMs Scott Bell added: "She knew at some
OL,8,Fpoint she would be arrested and that's
OL,9,Fexactly what happened.
OL,11,F"She was, and is, of the view that she
OL,12,Fis not guilty of the offences."
OL,14,FJudge Maher told Gwinnett: "Frankly
OL,15,Fyour apology carries no weight at all.
OL,17,F"As I said in October, you have
OL,18,Ftreated this process, as you did Joan
OL,19,FGreen, with utter contempt."
OL,26,@oD@VOUsD@AOUtD@_O]vD@\OUyD@AOU{D@\O]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/9
