OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785856710
OL,3,CFraudster who stole #300k from
OL,4,Cpensioner and fled to Spain has
OL,5,Csentence extended
OL,7,FIn 2025 Judge Maher sentenced her as
OL,8,Fif she was present.
OL,10,FHe said: "To you, Joan Green was
OL,11,Fsimply a cash cow to be milked until
OL,12,Fshe was dry.
OL,14,F"And so, having inveigled your way
OL,15,Finto their lives behind the charade
OL,16,Fthat you were a benevolent friend to
OL,17,FJoan, you set about playing the long
OL,18,Fgame to isolate and control a
OL,19,Fvulnerable woman and thereby enrich
OL,20,Fyourself.
OL,26,@rD@JOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/9
