OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F368A1785856710
OL,3,CFraudster who stole #300k from
OL,4,Cpensioner and fled to Spain has
OL,5,Csentence extended
OL,7,F"There was in my judgment a self-
OL,8,Fassured shamelessness to your
OL,9,Ffraudulent activity, to use the
OL,10,Fcolloquialism, you have some brass
OL,11,Fneck Ms Gwinnett."
OL,13,FAs part of her scam, Gwinnett made a
OL,14,Fseries of false claims against Mrs
OL,15,FGreen's stepdaughter and step-
OL,16,Fgrandchild, including theft and
OL,17,Fneglect, before she gained power of
OL,18,Fattorney.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@RO]
